OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by #488 a
OL,4,Ayear in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe triple lock has come under scrutiny
OL,7,Fin recent months as the number of
OL,8,Fpensioners is expected to rise in the
OL,9,Fcoming years, making the policy more
OL,10,Fexpensive.
